，却不想，江湖因此再度掀起血雨腥风。","series_id":"7488905056121539608","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623575726C3D15E84D222B8EAE8\",\"rank\":\"4\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7488905056121539608\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.06612411886453629,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.9060753583908081,\\\"like\\\":0.05184546485543251,\\\"finish\\\":0.03461884334683418,\\\"collect\\\":0.04208773002028465,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.0887550562620163,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":0.9677132964134216}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7488905056121539608","play_cnt":12684,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"麦芽短剧","sub_title":"古装·江湖武侠","score":"8.3","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":50,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5007,\"name\":\"古装\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5007&categoryName=古装&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5138,\"name\":\"江湖武侠\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5138&categoryName=江湖武侠&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5178,\"name\":\"逆风翻盘\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5178&categoryName=逆风翻盘&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5175,\"name\":\"打脸反派\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5175&categoryName=打脸反派&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5174,\"name\":\"矛盾和解\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5174&categoryName=矛盾和解&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5092,\"name\":\"故人重逢\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5092&categoryName=故人重逢&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5224,\"name\":\"大男主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5224&categoryName=大男主&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5287,